#X obj 230 78 cnv 1 535 274 empty empty empty 17 7 0 10 -237178 -1 0;
#X text 240 83 a reverberator based on the Dattorro reverb topology
with the default reverb parameters from the original paper;
#X text 240 138 Dattorro is Jon Dattorro \, whose 1997 paper "Effect
Design \, Part 1" became a classic reference for digital reverb design;
#X text 240 193 @decay sets the decay rate \, a value of 1.0 gives
infinite decay \, @damp controls the high-frequency damping;
#X text 240 233 @bw \, @idiff1 \, @idiff2 and @ddiff1 \, @ddiff2 control
the bandwidth filter and the diffusion stages;
#X text 240 273 @predelay sets the delay before the processed signal
\, @drywet mixes the original (dry) and processed signals;
#X obj 240 316 ui.link @background_color 0.90196 0.90196 0.90196
@title
